---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
const title='Seller Story: Unwanted Property Sold As-Is';
const description='Watch a real CashAsIs seller share her experience selling an unwanted property as-is and closing quickly without repairs or traditional sale hassles.';
const pubDate=new Date('2026-09-27');
const image='/images/unwanted-property-sold-as-is-seller-story-cashasis.png.png';
const videoUrl='https://player.vimeo.com/video/1201084643?h=11bc3640d6';
const faq=[
 {q:'Can CashAsIs buy an unwanted or vacant property as-is?',a:'Yes. CashAsIs buys properties as-is, including vacant, dated, and repair-heavy properties. You do not need to renovate or make the property market-ready first.'},
 {q:'Do I need to make repairs before getting an offer?',a:'No. CashAsIs reviews the property in its current condition and can make an offer without requiring repairs, staging, or traditional sale preparation first.'},
 {q:'Can CashAsIs help me close quickly?',a:'CashAsIs purchases directly and can work with title toward a closing timeline that fits the transaction. Actual timing depends on title, ownership, access, and other property-specific requirements.'}
];
const videoSchema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'VideoObject',name:'CashAsIs Seller Story: Unwanted Property Sold As-Is',description:'A real CashAsIs seller shares her experience selling an unwanted property as-is and closing quickly.',thumbnailUrl:['https://www.cashasis.com/images/unwanted-property-sold-as-is-seller-story-cashasis.png.png'],uploadDate:'2026-09-27',embedUrl:videoUrl};
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head>
<BaseHead title={title} description={description} image={image} type="article" pubDate={pubDate} author="CashAsIs" faq={faq}/>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"/>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(videoSchema)}/>
<style>.video-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#0D1B2A;margin:0 auto 28px;box-shadow:0 18px 42px -26px rgba(13,27,42,.6)}.video-wrap iframe{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}.story-points{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin:22px 0}.story-point{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:17px;text-align:center;background:#fbfcfd;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy)}@media(max-width:640px){.story-points{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
</head><body>
<Nav/>
<section class="legal-hero"><div class="in"><span class="badge">Real Seller Story</span><h1>Unwanted Property? Sold As-Is.</h1><p class="meta">A real CashAsIs seller shares her experience getting the property sold and moving forward without the traditional hassle.</p></div></section>
<main class="legal-wrap"><article class="legal-card article">
<p class="eyebrow"><a href="/blog/">&larr; More Seller Resources</a></p>
<div class="video-wrap"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1201084643?h=11bc3640d6&badge=0&autopause=0&player_id=0&app_id=58479" title="Unwanted property sold as-is CashAsIs seller story" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen loading="eager"></iframe></div>
<div class="article-body">
<p>Sometimes the easiest solution for a property you're no longer using is simply being done with it.</p>
<p>In this real seller story, hear directly from a CashAsIs seller about her experience selling and closing without turning the property into another long project.</p>
<div class="story-points"><div class="story-point">NO REPAIRS</div><div class="story-point">NO TRADITIONAL SALE HASSLE</div><div class="story-point">CLOSED FAST</div></div>
<h2>Sell the property as-is</h2>
<p>If a property is vacant, unwanted, dated, or needs work, you do not necessarily have to spend more money fixing it before finding out what it can sell for.</p>
<p>CashAsIs buys properties in their current condition. That means no requirement to renovate, stage, or make the property market-ready before we make an offer.</p>
<h2>Stop carrying a property you don't need</h2>
<p>An unused property can continue creating expenses through taxes, insurance, maintenance, utilities, lawn care, repairs, or simply the time required to manage it.</p>
<p>If you're ready to stop dealing with the property, a direct as-is sale can provide another path forward.</p>
<h2>A simpler closing process</h2>
<p>CashAsIs purchases directly and works with the title company to move the transaction toward closing. We coordinate the property side of the sale so you aren't trying to manage a traditional listing process on a property you already want to be done with.</p>
<p>Actual closing timing depends on title and the circumstances of the property, but our goal is simple: <strong>make selling straightforward.</strong></p>
<p>For more information, see <a href="/blog/still-paying-unused-property/">what holding an unused property may be costing</a> and <a href="/blog/empty-house-problems-dont-wait/">why vacant-property problems can grow while you wait</a>.</p>
<div class="callout"><p><b>Have a property you're ready to be done with?</b><br/>Send us the address and tell us a little about its condition. We'll review it and give you a no-obligation CashAsIs offer.</p></div>
</div>
<section class="faq"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>{faq.map((f)=><details><summary>{f.q}</summary><p>{f.a}</p></details>)}</section>
</article></main><Footer/>
<script is:inline src="https://link.msgsndr.com/js/external-tracking.js" data-tracking-id="tk_61336d42285a45a29bdc44b9a0947ddf"></script>
</body></html>